(
F4 T5 follow-up, 2026-10-10: the hardening-soil yield function reads
gamma_p = kappa at the STEP-START value plus the increment of its own
return mapping, stress.cc set_stress pl_unknowns, never the nodal
kappa written by a previous material evaluation of the same step.
Input = test-2014 mhardsoil_plast: one quad4, zero total strain, initial
sigxx -4, hardsoil m 0, relaxation at the integration point; with
control_timestep_iterations 2. The result must not depend on the number
of equilibrium iterations: kap 0.00104991189, sigxx -3.11898011, sigyy
-0.517426372 for 1, 2, 3, 4 and 8 iterations. Hand check of the end
state: sigma = sigma0 - C eps_p with E50 1000 and nu 0.3 holds exactly,
kap = sqrt of 0.5 eps_p:eps_p, and the yield value
f = q/E50/[1-q/qa] - 2q/Eur - kap = 5e-9.
Old GNU, gamma_p from the nodal kappa of the previous evaluation, a
period-2 oscillation: kap 0.0030029 / sigxx -1.48018 with 1 or 3
iterations, kap 0.0005995 / sigxx -2.469 to -2.489 with 2, 4 or 8.
No Professional oracle: it returns a zero field on this input.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
derivatives
materi_velocity
materi_velocity_integrated
materi_strain_total
materi_strain_plasti
materi_plasti_kappa
materi_plasti_hardsoil_history
materi_stress
materi_strain_plasti_hardsoil
number_of_integration_points 4
end_initia

bounda_time  0  0 0 100 0
